  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="c120512a-da82-5a06-ab17-e3391bf0aceb" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Reconcile one immutable period snapshot with bounded checkpoints at 02:00 UTC.&#10;Missing or ambiguous accepted snapshot leaves the period BLOCKED without expiring members.&#10;At 02:00 UTC for date D apply valid renewals first; expire only validThrough &lt; D.&#10;Never shorten validity; unknown/conflicting renewals become discrepancies.&#10;Checkpoint bounded pages and resume with one reminder per member/period/kind; corrections are new snapshot revisions.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
